            "specific_business_event",
            "current_industry_context",
            "management_statement"
          ],
          "source_role": "management",
          "excerpt": "And because of the supply-demand imbalance, we've been talking about, when we can make efficiency gains, they are quickly monetized in quarter."
        },
        {
