          },
          "quality_flags": [],
          "topics": [],
          "selection_reasons": [
            "linked_question_context"
          ],
          "source_role": "analyst",
          "excerpt": "Amy, impressive acceleration in Azure up to 43% going to mid-40s. I guess the questions around the underlying drivers, what you and Satya are seeing in terms of just what's driving this and mainly the question is around capacity constraints"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:f9a1a5265fc6a0cc3814b6ae8f598c7a480d0fd911b26ac2d15295a415d9e425",
